{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33002","headline":"去不返 · 曹邺","name":"去不返","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒女不自知，嫁爲公子妻。\n亲情未识面，明日便东西。\n但得上马了，一去头不回。\n双轮如鸟飞，影尽东南街。\n九重十二门，一门四扇开。\n君从此路去，妾向此路啼。\n但得见君面，不辞插荆钗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33002.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33002","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}